9. Hence, the present application is allowed and the applicant is ordered to be released on regular bail in connection with the FIR being C.R. No.11196003230710 of 2023 registered with the Manjalpur Police Station, Vadodara, on executing a personal bond of Rs.15,000/- (Rupees Fifteen Thousand only) with one surety of the like amount to the satisfaction of the trial Court and subject Aashish Jaychand Gavali vs State Of Gujarat on 13 February, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/124499053/
NEUTRA  R/CR.MA/2859/2024 ORDER DATED: 13/02/2024  undefin  [c] surrender passport, if any, to the lower court within  a week;
